pleted": 0}, "issue_dependencies_summary": {"blocked_by": 0, "total_blocked_by": 0, "blocking": 0, "total_blocking": 0}, "body": "Hi all, I'm new here trying to develop some missions in order to be able to do the inspection of a building with a drone. I started following the steps in [https://mavsdk.mavlink.io/develop/en/cpp/quickstart.html](url) but I'm blocked where I have to run the example of the takeoff and landing. I've followed every step precisely and still having the following issue when running the \"./takeoff_and_land udp://:14540\",  where I'm obtaining the following: \r\n\r\n[06:42:30|Info ] MAVSDK version: v0.36.0 (mavsdk_impl.cpp:21)\r\nWaiting to discover system...\r\n[06:42:30|Info ] New system on: 127.0.0.1:14580 (with sysid: 1) (udp_connection.cpp:190)\r\n[06:42:30|Debug] New: System ID: 1 Comp ID: 1 (mavsdk_impl.cpp:418)\r\n[06:42:30|Debug] Component Autopilot (1) added. (system_impl.cpp:324)\r\n[06:42:30|Debug] Discovered 1 component(s) (UUID: 5283920058631409231) (system_impl.cpp:481)\r\nDiscovered system\r\n[06:42:30|Debug] MAVLink: info: [logger] ./log/2021-02-23/02_40_40.ulg (system_impl.cpp:230)\r\n[06:42:30|Debug] New: System ID: 255 Comp ID: 190 (mavsdk_impl.cpp:418)\r\n[06:42:30|Debug] Component Unsupported component (190) added. (system_impl.cpp:324)\r\n[06:42:30|Debug] Discovered 1 component(s) (UUID: 255) (system_impl.cpp:481)\r\nDiscovered system\r\nDiscovered a component with type 0\r\n[06:42:32|Warn ] sending again after 0.50133 s, retries to do: 3  (511). (mavlink_commands.cpp:239)\r\n[06:42:33|Warn ] sending again after 1.00945 s, retries to do: 2  (511). (mavlink_commands.cpp:239)\r\n[06:42:33|Warn ] sending again after 1.51695 s, retries to do: 1  (511). (mavlink_commands.cpp:239)\r\n[06:42:34|Error] Retrying failed (511) (mavlink_commands.cpp:260)\r\n[06:42:34|Warn ] sending again after 0.50922 s, retries to do: 3  (511). (mavlink_commands.cpp:239)\r\n[06:42:35|Warn ] sending again after 1.01631 s, retries to do: 2  (511). (mavlink_commands.cpp:239)\r\n[06:42:35|Warn ] sending again after 1.52332 s, retries to do: 1  (511). (mavlink_commands.cpp:239)\r\n[06:42:36|Error] Retrying failed (511) (mavlink_commands.cpp:260)\r\nSetting rate failed:Connection Error\r\n\r\nMy guess is that I have to change some mavlinks connection or even the IP, I've tried to change the MAV_BROADCAST to 1 but I'm still having the same issue. I've tried also to reinstall everything and still having the same issue and I did not find anything on the internet about that error. My idea is, after seeing that the examples works, trying to do the same with a fly_mission example and then my target is to create a mission with .csv file where I have all the 3D coordinates and launch it in the SITL (gazebo or jmavsim).\r\n\r\nAny ideas where the solution could be?\r\n\r\nThank you all in advance,\r\n", "closed_by": {"login": "julianoes", "id": 1419688, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjE0MTk2ODg=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1419688?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes", "html_url": "https://github.com/julianoes", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1327/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 